~ start

ERNESTO: [speed=0.6][shake rate=3 level=2]...The harvest...[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.1][shake rate=10 level=6][b]Ernesto, forget the harvest! We need to get the children somewhere safe![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.1][shake rate=12 level=7][b]You think I don't know that?![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0][shake rate=10 level=6][b]I worked those fields for months! We can't just lose everything we've worked for![/b][/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.1][shake rate=12 level=7][b]And what good will the harvest do us if we don't survive this?![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=3]...This house has stood through every storm we've had.[/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0][shake rate=10 level=6][b]Not like this, Ernesto! Look around you![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0][shake rate=9 level=5][b]The roof is still holding, isn't it?![/b][/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.8][shake rate=10 level=6][b]Tatay![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.8][shake rate=7 level=4]Just... hold on! We'll find a way out![/shake][/speed]

PILI: [speed=1.0][shake rate=9 level=5][b]We can't keep waiting for things to get worse![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=1.0][shake rate=10 level=6][b]I'm not waiting! I'm trying to find a way down without getting us swept away![/b][/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9][shake rate=7 level=4]There has to be a way. We just need to think![/shake][/speed]

[speed=0.6]Tatay's scared...But he won't say it.[/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.9][shake rate=5 level=3]Stay close to me, everyone. We're getting out of here.[/shake][/speed]

ERNESTO: [speed=0.7][shake rate=4 level=2][b]We're not losing everything today.[/b][/shake][/speed]
=> END